### Register a new Organization + User
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organizationName": "VoteHub Demo",
  "country": "Ghana",
  "timezone": "Africa/Accra",
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "Password123"
}

###